/* The atlas's modern look: the window frame left of the modern minimap, its
   top right 160dp from the screen's right edge and 12dp from the top, the
   title row with the map chip, and the map image (the view at the atlas
   image's size, 256dp for most maps) in a well: a 1dp rim, a faint grid of
   32dp cells and a vignette over the map, in one box that takes no
   pointer, so the view keeps its hover. Nothing clips the view: it makes
   itself the containing block of its hover label (ElementView), and a
   clipping well would cut the label at the map's edge, so the rim keeps
   small corners (radius-sm) that the square map fills. The window's width
   and height follow the view's: RmlUi counts an inline-level replaced box
   in a window's shrink-to-fit width, and not a block-level one, so the
   well and the view are inline-blocks on the line's top. Classic (the
   stone board with the legacy title bar, the view at 7, 30, the frame 15dp
   wider and 38dp taller than the image, its left edge 402dp left of the
   screen's right edge): skins/classic/windows/atlas.rcss. */

/* No window minimum: 18 of the 37 atlas images are narrower than the
   frame's 240dp allows (171 px for Pyungmoo, metin2_map_c1), which left an
   empty strip right of the map. */
body.atlas
{
	left: auto;
	right: 160dp;
	top: 12dp;
	min-width: 0;
	focus: none;
	tab-index: none;
}
.atlas button
{
	tab-index: none;
	focus: none;
}
/* The map chip left of the title. */
.atlas__title-icon
{
	display: inline-block;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	width: 24dp;
	height: 24dp;
	margin-right: var(--space-2);
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--accent);
	border-radius: 7dp;
	background-color: var(--selection);
	line-height: 22dp;
	text-align: center;
	vertical-align: middle;
}
.atlas__title-icon .nui-glyph
{
	--glyph-ink: var(--accent);
}
.atlas__body
{
	display: block;
	padding: 10dp var(--space-4) var(--space-4);
}
.atlas__map
{
	display: inline-block;
	position: relative;
	vertical-align: top;
	background-color: var(--surface-sunken);
}
.atlas__view
{
	display: inline-block;
	vertical-align: top;
}
/* Over the map: the grid, the vignette and the rim. */
.atlas__grid
{
	display: block;
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	top: 0;
	right: 0;
	bottom: 0;
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--border);
	border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
	decorator: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0dp, transparent 31dp, var(--border) 31dp, var(--border) 32dp),
	           repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0dp, transparent 31dp, var(--border) 31dp, var(--border) 32dp),
	           radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 58%, var(--cooldown-shade) 130%);
	pointer-events: none;
}
/* The hint opens left of the close button, inside the window. */
.atlas__tip
{
	left: auto;
	right: 100%;
	bottom: auto;
	top: 0;
	margin-bottom: 0;
	margin-right: var(--space-1);
	margin-left: -320dp;
}
